{"page":82,"verses":[{"verse_key":"4:24","surah":4,"ayah":24,"ar_uthmani":"۞ وَٱلْمُحْصَنَـٰتُ مِنَ ٱلنِّسَآءِ إِلَّا مَا مَلَكَتْ أَيْمَـٰنُكُمْ ۖ كِتَـٰبَ ٱللَّهِ عَلَيْكُمْ ۚ وَأُحِلَّ لَكُم مَّا وَرَآءَ ذَٰلِكُمْ أَن تَبْتَغُوا۟ بِأَمْوَٰلِكُم مُّحْصِنِينَ غَيْرَ مُسَـٰفِحِينَ ۚ فَمَا ٱسْتَمْتَعْتُم بِهِۦ مِنْهُنَّ فَـَٔاتُوهُنَّ أُجُورَهُنَّ فَرِيضَةً ۚ وَلَا جُنَاحَ عَلَيْكُمْ فِيمَا تَرَٰضَيْتُم بِهِۦ مِنۢ بَعْدِ ٱلْفَرِيضَةِ ۚ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ كَانَ عَلِيمًا حَكِيمًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"women already married, other than your slaves.God has ordained all this for you. Other women are lawful to you, so long as you seek them in marriage, with gifts from your property, looking for wedlock rather than fornication. If you wish to enjoy women through marriage, give them their bride-gift- this is obligatory- though if you should choose mutually, after fulfilling this obligation, to do otherwise [with the bride-gift], you will not be blamed: God is all knowing and all wise.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ وَٱلْمُحْصَنَـٰتُ","en_gloss":"And (prohibited are) the ones who are married","transliteration":"wal-muḥ'ṣanātu","verse_key":"4:24"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"4:24"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلنِّسَآءِ","en_gloss":"the women","transliteration":"l-nisāi","verse_key":"4:24"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"4:24"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"whom","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"4:24"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مَلَكَتْ","en_gloss":"you possess","transliteration":"malakat","verse_key":"4:24"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَيْمَـٰنُكُمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"rightfully","transliteration":"aymānukum","verse_key":"4:24"},{"pos":8,"ar":"كِتَـٰبَ","en_gloss":"Decree","transliteration":"kitāba","verse_key":"4:24"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"4:24"},{"pos":10,"ar":"عَلَيْكُمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"upon you","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","verse_key":"4:24"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَأُحِلَّ","en_gloss":"And are lawful","transliteration":"wa-uḥilla","verse_key":"4:24"},{"pos":12,"ar":"لَكُم","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"4:24"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مَّا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"4:24"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَرَآءَ","en_gloss":"(is) beyond","transliteration":"warāa","verse_key":"4:24"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ذَٰلِكُمْ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"dhālikum","verse_key":"4:24"},{"pos":16,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"4:24"},{"pos":17,"ar":"تَبْتَغُوا۟","en_gloss":"you seek","transliteration":"tabtaghū","verse_key":"4:24"},{"pos":18,"ar":"بِأَمْوَٰلِكُم","en_gloss":"with your wealth","transliteration":"bi-amwālikum","verse_key":"4:24"},{"pos":19,"ar":"مُّحْصِنِينَ","en_gloss":"desiring to be chaste","transliteration":"muḥ'ṣinīna","verse_key":"4:24"},{"pos":20,"ar":"غَيْرَ","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"ghayra","verse_key":"4:24"},{"pos":21,"ar":"مُسَـٰفِحِينَ ۚ","en_gloss":"(to be) lustful","transliteration":"musāfiḥīna","verse_key":"4:24"},{"pos":22,"ar":"فَمَا","en_gloss":"So what","transliteration":"famā","verse_key":"4:24"},{"pos":23,"ar":"ٱسْتَمْتَعْتُم","en_gloss":"you benefit[ed]","transliteration":"is'tamtaʿtum","verse_key":"4:24"},{"pos":24,"ar":"بِهِۦ","en_gloss":"of it","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"4:24"},{"pos":25,"ar":"مِنْهُنَّ","en_gloss":"from them","transliteration":"min'hunna","verse_key":"4:24"},{"pos":26,"ar":"فَـَٔاتُوهُنَّ","en_gloss":"so you give them","transliteration":"faātūhunna","verse_key":"4:24"},{"pos":27,"ar":"أُجُورَهُنَّ","en_gloss":"their bridal due","transliteration":"ujūrahunna","verse_key":"4:24"},{"pos":28,"ar":"فَرِيضَةًۭ ۚ","en_gloss":"(as) an obligation","transliteration":"farīḍatan","verse_key":"4:24"},{"pos":29,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"And (there is) no","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"4:24"},{"pos":30,"ar":"جُنَاحَ","en_gloss":"sin","transliteration":"junāḥa","verse_key":"4:24"},{"pos":31,"ar":"عَلَيْكُمْ","en_gloss":"on you","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","verse_key":"4:24"},{"pos":32,"ar":"فِيمَا","en_gloss":"concerning what","transliteration":"fīmā","verse_key":"4:24"},{"pos":33,"ar":"تَرَٰضَيْتُم","en_gloss":"you mutually agree","transliteration":"tarāḍaytum","verse_key":"4:24"},{"pos":34,"ar":"بِهِۦ","en_gloss":"of it","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"4:24"},{"pos":35,"ar":"مِنۢ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"4:24"},{"pos":36,"ar":"بَعْدِ","en_gloss":"beyond","transliteration":"baʿdi","verse_key":"4:24"},{"pos":37,"ar":"ٱلْفَرِيضَةِ ۚ","en_gloss":"the obligation","transliteration":"l-farīḍati","verse_key":"4:24"},{"pos":38,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"4:24"},{"pos":39,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"4:24"},{"pos":40,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"is","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"4:24"},{"pos":41,"ar":"عَلِيمًا","en_gloss":"All-Knowing","transliteration":"ʿalīman","verse_key":"4:24"},{"pos":42,"ar":"حَكِيمًۭا","en_gloss":"All-Wise","transliteration":"ḥakīman","verse_key":"4:24"},{"pos":43,"ar":"٢٤","en_gloss":"(24)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"4:24"}]},{"verse_key":"4:25","surah":4,"ayah":25,"ar_uthmani":"وَمَن لَّمْ يَسْتَطِعْ مِنكُمْ طَوْلًا أَن يَنكِحَ ٱلْمُحْصَنَـٰتِ ٱلْمُؤْمِنَـٰتِ فَمِن مَّا مَلَكَتْ أَيْمَـٰنُكُم مِّن فَتَيَـٰتِكُمُ ٱلْمُؤْمِنَـٰتِ ۚ وَٱللَّهُ أَعْلَمُ بِإِيمَـٰنِكُم ۚ بَعْضُكُم مِّنۢ بَعْضٍ ۚ فَٱنكِحُوهُنَّ بِإِذْنِ أَهْلِهِنَّ وَءَاتُوهُنَّ أُجُورَهُنَّ بِٱلْمَعْرُوفِ مُحْصَنَـٰتٍ غَيْرَ مُسَـٰفِحَـٰتٍ وَلَا مُتَّخِذَٰتِ أَخْدَانٍ ۚ فَإِذَآ أُحْصِنَّ فَإِنْ أَتَيْنَ بِفَـٰحِشَةٍ فَعَلَيْهِنَّ نِصْفُ مَا عَلَى ٱلْمُحْصَنَـٰتِ مِنَ ٱلْعَذَابِ ۚ ذَٰلِكَ لِمَنْ خَشِىَ ٱلْعَنَتَ مِنكُمْ ۚ وَأَن تَصْبِرُوا۟ خَيْرٌ لَّكُمْ ۗ وَٱللَّهُ غَفُورٌ رَّحِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"If any of you does not have the means to marry a believing free woman, then marry a believing slave- God knows best [the depth of] your faith: you are [all] part of the same family- so marry them with their people’s consent and their proper bride-gifts. [Make them] married women, not adulteresses or lovers. If they commit adultery when they are married, their punishment will be half that of free women. This is for those of you who fear that you will sin; it is better for you to practise selfrestraint. God is most forgiving and merciful,","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمَن","en_gloss":"And whoever","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"4:25"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لَّمْ","en_gloss":"(is) not","transliteration":"lam","verse_key":"4:25"},{"pos":3,"ar":"يَسْتَطِعْ","en_gloss":"able to","transliteration":"yastaṭiʿ","verse_key":"4:25"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِنكُمْ","en_gloss":"among you","transliteration":"minkum","verse_key":"4:25"},{"pos":5,"ar":"طَوْلًا","en_gloss":"afford","transliteration":"ṭawlan","verse_key":"4:25"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"4:25"},{"pos":7,"ar":"يَنكِحَ","en_gloss":"marry","transliteration":"yankiḥa","verse_key":"4:25"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلْمُحْصَنَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"the free chaste","transliteration":"l-muḥ'ṣanāti","verse_key":"4:25"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلْمُؤْمِنَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"[the] believing women","transliteration":"l-mu'mināti","verse_key":"4:25"},{"pos":10,"ar":"فَمِن","en_gloss":"then (marry) from","transliteration":"famin","verse_key":"4:25"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مَّا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"4:25"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مَلَكَتْ","en_gloss":"possess[ed]","transliteration":"malakat","verse_key":"4:25"},{"pos":13,"ar":"أَيْمَـٰنُكُم","en_gloss":"your right hands","transliteration":"aymānukum","verse_key":"4:25"},{"pos":14,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"4:25"},{"pos":15,"ar":"فَتَيَـٰتِكُمُ","en_gloss":"your slave girls ","transliteration":"fatayātikumu","verse_key":"4:25"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ٱلْمُؤْمِنَـٰتِ ۚ","en_gloss":"(of) the believers","transliteration":"l-mu'mināti","verse_key":"4: